# ── Compiled programs ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# clang++ / g++ write executables with no file extension, right next to
# their .cpp. So ignore every extensionless file, but keep folders and any
# file that has a dot in its name…
*
!*/
!*.*

# …and keep the extensionless files that are real sources or scripts.
# Saved a source file without an extension? Add a "!path" line here.
!Makefile
!makefile
!GNUmakefile
!Dockerfile
!LICENSE
!README
!Learning/CPP_Crash_Course_Book/quest
!Learning/Random/terminal
!SublimeC++/Contest Codeforces 9 NOV 2024
!SublimeC++/atcoder
!SublimeC++/random_AVL
!SublimeC++/CSES_BUILDING_ROADS
!opencv_project/src/finger_count
!usaco/cses

# ── Other build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────
*.dSYM/
*.o
*.out
.build/

# ── macOS & editors ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# ── Jupyter autosaves ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Xcode per-user state ─────────────────────────────────────────────
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

# ── Book PDFs (copyrighted and large; keep them local) ───────────────
Learning/CPP_Crash_Course_Book/**/*.pdf
